DATA: the MIT license covers this repository's code and documentation only. The datasets are
published research data, downloaded at run time and not stored here:
- Card & Krueger (1994) fast-food survey, distributed by David Card (via a GitHub mirror).
- Abadie, Diamond & Hainmueller (2010) Proposition 99 panel (via a GitHub mirror).
- NSW/CPS (LaLonde 1986; Dehejia & Wahba 1999) and organ-donation data from the `causaldata`
  Python package (MIT), which bundles the datasets used in "Causal Inference: The Mixtape"
  (Cunningham) and "The Effect" (Huntington-Klein).
Cite the original papers when reusing results.
